{"id":"ce2e952933d30cc2","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-expressive-completeness.md","title":"标准扩张中真理外延的语义充分性","display":"df-expressive-completeness — 标准扩张中真理外延的语义充分性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-expressive-completeness","aliases":["91-df-expressive-completeness","91-df-expressive"],"display":"df-expressive-completeness — 标准扩张中真理外延的语义充分性","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-expansion]]","[[91-df-coded-syntax]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-expressive-completeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-expressive-completeness</span><span>91-df-expressive</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-expressive-completeness — 标准扩张中真理外延的语义充分性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7f5043d4200f56d1\" href=\"?note=7f5043d4200f56d1\" title=\"91-df-truth-expansion\">91-df-truth-expansion</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"38c875c58a0bf84c\" href=\"?note=38c875c58a0bf84c\" title=\"91-df-coded-syntax\">91-df-coded-syntax</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>基础结构固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N_T=(\\mathbb N,T\\mapsto A)\">\\(\\mathfrak N_T=(\\mathbb N,T\\mapsto A)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_0\">\\(C_0\\)</span> 为基础句子编码集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathbb N}=\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0},\\mathbb N\\models\\varphi\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathbb N}=\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0},\\mathbb N\\models\\varphi\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExpComp}\">\\(\\mathrm{ExpComp}\\)</span> 为下述本地语义属性。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}expressive\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{ExpComp}(T,\\mathfrak N_T)\\coloneqq A=\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathbb N}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}expressive\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{ExpComp}(T,\\mathfrak N_T)\\coloneqq A=\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathbb N}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExpComp}(T,\\mathfrak N_T)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\left[A\\subseteq C_0\\ \\land\\ \\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\bigl(\\mathfrak N_T\\models T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\\bigr)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ExpComp}(T,\\mathfrak N_T)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\left[A\\subseteq C_0\\ \\land\\ \\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\bigl(\\mathfrak N_T\\models T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\\bigr)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>旧等价遗漏了 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq C_0\">\\(A\\subseteq C_0\\)</span>：逐句双条件不限制非句子编码或含真理句子的编码。旧版本还将元层自然数代码集直接等同于任意非标准模型的论域子集，存在类型错误，现限定标准基础结构。\n此处的 ExpComp 是目录的语义充分性简称，不是原书对“表达完备”的统一技术定义。TB 模型可在基础句代码外任意赋 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>，所以模型满足 TB 不自动给出本定义的精确全域等式。\n语义正确解释不等于在一个可递归理论中证明全部真算术句，更不自动推出非保守性。</p>\n<p>来源：§2 的语义充分性、Definition 8.1 的标准真句集；等式的域修正为直接集合论推导。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-expansion","status":"resolved","id":"7f5043d4200f56d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-expansion]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-coded-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"38c875c58a0bf84c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-coded-syntax]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak N_T=(\\mathbb N,T\\mapsto A)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"C_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathbb N}=\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0},\\mathbb N\\models\\varphi\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ExpComp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}expressive\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{ExpComp}(T,\\mathfrak N_T)\\coloneqq A=\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathbb N}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ExpComp}(T,\\mathfrak N_T)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\left[A\\subseteq C_0\\ \\land\\ \\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\bigl(\\mathfrak N_T\\models T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\\bigr)\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"A\\subseteq C_0","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":1894,"backlinks":[{"id":"850f86d5448feae4","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbb N$ 与 $\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathbb N}$ 采用 [[91-df-expressive-completeness]]；$\\tau(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}$。"},{"id":"ae206ab556213266","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"07845482f0a2f378","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-54","locations